# Edit decision list for Shawn in China ep. 1, v2 (30 Oct 2026 voiceover, vo.m4a).
#
# One beat = one or more VO phrases (chunk numbers from vo2_tx.py, or [start, end] seconds in vo_raw.wav).
# shots: "Folder/File[@in]" optionally followed by " ~word": the shot cuts in on that word of the beat
#        (first match after the previous cue). The first shot always starts with the beat.
#        "VIZ:name" = a full-screen motion graphic instead of footage.
# fx:    on-screen layers and sound effects, each cued to a word ("~word") or a time offset (float, s):
#        ("sticker", emoji, cue, pos)   die-cut emoji that pops in and bobs
#        ("pill", text, cue, pos)       rounded label; pos as below
#        ("loc", text, cue)             location lower third with a pin
#        ("big", text, cue)             big kinetic headline, centre
#        ("count", value, cue, label, fmt)  count-up number + label, centre
#        ("sfx", name, cue)             sound effect from the synth kit
#        pos: tl tr bl br tc bc c, or (x, y) in 1920x1080 space
# nat:   (shot, seconds) natural-sound moment played after the beat with no VO
# chapter: day card shown at the start of the beat
# Every clip appears once in the whole film. WeChat clips were shot by a friend and get a small credit tag.
